# Patterns for secret scanners to skip. One regular expression per line
# (RE2/Go syntax, the format TruffleHog's --exclude-paths parses; the gate
# validates each line with Python's re). NOT gitignore-glob syntax.
# See docs/secret-files-are-never-tracked.md.
#
# TruffleHog reads this file directly via --exclude-paths. detect-secrets does
# NOT read it (its --exclude-files takes a single regex, not a file); mirror any
# path exclusion here into the detect-secrets `exclude:` regex in
# .pre-commit-config.yaml.
#
# This is a docs-only repo — add a pattern here when a tracked file triggers a
# false positive, rather than adding it to .gitignore.
